# Selecting every Starred entry and pressing * empties the view, and one undo brings all of them back.
file <<END
Home:
	- Water plants @star
	- Call plumber @star
Work:
	- Expense report @star
END
keys gS <C-a> *
hide Water plants
hide Expense report
keys z
see - Water plants
see - Call plumber
see - Expense report
quit
saved <<END
Home:
	- Water plants @star
	- Call plumber @star
Work:
	- Expense report @star
END
